// French horn, staccato: VSCO 2 Community Edition (CC0), sgossner/VSCO-2-CE@440300901d, folder 'Brass/F Horn/stac'.
// Written by tools/music/build.mjs (tools/music/instruments.mjs); played by tools/music/sampler.mjs.
// Gain staging: loudest layer calibrated to -20 LUFS-M on MOHorn_stac_A2_v3_rr1.wav (measured -16.8).
